{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2606Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932350/extras/d1f307a820285527f6d59d486b60d180.avif?t=1766549099\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a day in summer holiday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You recently started living alone in the city, and are beginning to get worn out by the busy days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noises of the town, complicated relationship with others... Momentarily, your heart yearned for a moment of peaceful rest in a quiet place</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It made you recall your time back when you live on a small island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by nature, living a free life, the time of serenity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Led by the nostalgia, you made a phone call to an old lady running a guesthouse at the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What came back was a cheerful welcome along with an unexpected favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cOur daughters will be on their own for a while, can you look after them?\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This marks the start of the 14 days of your summer break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beginning of special days with two girls in a nostalgic island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2606Heroines Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932350/extras/d5bfffd819a29872b08792c77b13fb1b.avif?t=1766549099\" width=216 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honoka Amane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elder sister of your childhood friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's kind and gentle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's been helping out the guesthouse since young and is good at cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She looks matured to others around her, but she can be spacey at times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After not meeting for a while, she sees you grown up to be so manly,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an gets nervous deep inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932350/extras/b3e899666fe15e420c19ba4f58f659a1.avif?t=1766549099\" width=216 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hinano Amane</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The younger sister of your childhood friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She rarely shows her expressions, and is sometimes absent-minded,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but she's been helping her dad in shipwright and has skillful hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She loves odd things, and sometimes brings back something from abandoned buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her face doesn't show it, but she's happy to get to meet you again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2606How to Spend Your Time on the Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two girls wiill be spending their time freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring them along with you to explore the island, or ask them for sex......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also make sure to take up their requests and build your relationships with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And eventually, form sweet bonds with them so that they will do you &quot;favors&quot; anytime, anywhere......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932350/extras/4fc1db5de4dfbe8f0840791fef72d6c1.avif?t=1766549099\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFreely roaming a nostalgic island, brining heroines along and have sex anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbVarious costumes to change into, which will also be reflected in pixel H scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMain story and H scenes all fully voiced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAbundance of high-quality HCG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFishing mini-game near the waterside, fish caught can be viewed in fish gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSpecial pixel H animations unlocked through certain conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbH Status window with all your sexual records with both heroines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2606Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fish at certain spots of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls are looking forward to you fishing and filling up the fish gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the gallery is completed, maybe something good will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932350/extras/c560fc2b43d3c2f0294da904586a9749.avif?t=1766549099\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2606H Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932350/extras/e5fec1a99d915d57ff5e1395a65bff36.avif?t=1766549099\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6H Anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000You can bring the girls along, and have sex with them anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Once cetain conditi